Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Salamat po, Atty. Del Rosario. Atty. Justin, are you ready for your cross?

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:31.760
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor, with the court's permission.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:34.140
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: When you're ready, you may proceed.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.240
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor. Turning to my cross.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.360
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sir Del Rosario, Atty. Del Rosario, magandang umaga po.

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:42.550
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Magandang umaga po sa inyo.

00:10:42.550 --> 00:11:00.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Good morning. Simulan po natin sir. During your direct examination yesterday, you identified records belonging to several corporations. In general, yung mga records na ito are those on file or are available with the records of the SEC or the Securities and Exchange Commission. Tama po ba?

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:01.860
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:11.110
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And now, the SEC compiled and produced these documents or these records upon the request of the House of Representatives. Tama po ba?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.910
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Direquest po nila sa amin yan.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:23.780
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes. And you confirmed that these corporate records were actually first requested po in relation to the hearings of the House of Representatives Committee on Justice. Naalala niyo po iyon?

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:24.350
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:32.180
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes. And you confirmed that you also testified under oath during that committee hearings before the House of Representatives. Tama po?

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:32.730
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:38.790
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And can you please confirm, sir, whether this date was on April 22, 2026? Can you recall that?

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:57.220
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang matandaan ko po ay ang subpina, ang date po niya is April 14, pero hindi naman po agad kami natanong noon. Patuloy siya, hindi ko na po matandaan yung exactong pecha. Kung kailan po ako natanong during that impeachment proceeding sa Committee

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:11.210
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: of Justice. Okay lang po, Atty. Delosario. Now, tama po bang sabihin, sir, na yung Securities and Exchange Commission ay nag-compile and release ng corporate documents base po sa informasyon na binigay ng House of Representatives.

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:15.810
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po kung ano po yung kanilang hiniling sa amin yung po ang ibinigay namin.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:24.935
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: In other words, yung House of Representatives po yung nagbigay ng informasyon at listahan ng mga kumpanya kung anong mga kumpanya ang iko-compile nyo yung mga records nila.

00:12:24.935 --> 00:12:26.110
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:41.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, kahapon po nung direct examination ni Atty. Matib, you testified and answered, or just please correct me, that you stated na hindi naman po kayo personally aware sa mga contents ng SAL-N ng ating VC Presidente. Tama po ba?

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:47.710
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. Wala po akong access sa SAL-N ng kahit sino po.

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:50.870
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Besides your own SAL-N, tama

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:50.910
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: po ba?

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.650
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yun lang pong SAL-N ko ang alam kong

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:53.620
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: nakikita ko.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:13:12.760
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Tama. And you confirm also, sir, and just for the record, pakikonfirm na lang po na yung Securities and Exchange Commission natin sa Pilipinas as an office would also have no information about the contents of any salens of other public officers including specifically the salen of the Vice President. Tama po ba?

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.160
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. Hindi po sa amin ang lagakan

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.120
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ng mga salen.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:36.670
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So yung tanong ko po, at the time when you first compiled and gathered all the documents, corporate records that are on file or maintained by the Securities and Exchange Commission, wala pong personal na knowledge yung SEC na yung mga korporasyon na iyon ay nakadeklara o nakalagay sa salay ng ating vicepresidente?

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:38.290
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:38.690
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: namin

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:39.030
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: alam.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:46.740
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: In other words, is it correct to say that the SEC merely relied on the information provided by the House of Representatives?

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:47.430
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Objection.

00:13:47.650 --> 00:14:00.270
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Just to clarify, Your Honor, is the Council is referring to the SEC, Your Honor. Perhaps he should refer to this witness, Your Honor, because SEC, we're talking about an institution, Your Honor.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.470
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: The documents come from the SEC, Your Honor.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:09.710
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: It's a comment, Atty. Justin, anyway. Atty. Erwin, you may proceed, Atty. Justin.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:18.530
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat po, Your Honor. Kayo po, kayo po mismo at ang opisina niyo, nag-rely lang po kayo sa impormasyon na pinigay ng House of Representatives.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:19.605
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:14:19.605 --> 00:14:35.830
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And you confirm that as the representative of the Securities and Exchange Commission, specifically the Company Registration and Monitoring Department, your testimony Before this court is limited to the records that are maintained by your division. Tama po ba?

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:36.770
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:51.100
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, kahapon din po, Atty. Del Rosario, nag-identify din po kayo for the first time ng mga summaries na supposedly and according to you, prepared by your office. Do you recall that?

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:53.260
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. Naalala ko po.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:15:03.780
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And according to you, these summaries were supposedly prepared by the Securities and Exchange Commission upon the request of the Prosecution Panel. Tama po ba?

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:04.980
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:15.890
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And specifically, this request from the Prosecution Panel of the House of Representatives is through a letter dated September 10, 2026. Tama po ba?

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:16.810
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.880
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At sino po yung pumirma nung letter request na yun galing sa House of Representatives?

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.980
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang nakalagda po sa request na yun ay si Congresswoman Louise Stroh.

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:35.835
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And in relation to that request that we are just discussing now, Atty., You confirmed that your office prepared two separate sets of summaries nung pinakita natin kahapon.

00:15:35.835 --> 00:15:37.000
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:50.330
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Particularly, isa dito is yung may label na tinatawag na Summary of Vice President Duterte Shareholdings tapos sa ibang pages naman, Manassas R. Carpio Shareholdings. Naalala niyo po?

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.860
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.160
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Kayo po ba yung naglagay ng label na yun?

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.020
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:16:06.385
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. My next question. Now, this summary contains several information relative to articles of incorporation and general information sheets of various corporations. Do you confirm that?

00:16:06.385 --> 00:16:07.430
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Apo.

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:12.470
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And do you have that document with you now? I'll be going into those documents.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:15.040
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Dala ko po. Nasa holding room lang yung mga dokument.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:28.740
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sige. Your Honor, just to allow the witness to have that document since my cross will pertain to that, may we just request that the witness be allowed to secure those documents or if the prosecution... could help and provide the witness with that document.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:39.040
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Your Honor, if I may be clarified, yung summary po, dala ko ngayon, pero yung pinanggalingan po ng buod ng summary ko ay nasa holding room po.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:50.840
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Ah, okay. I'm referring to particularly po, Atty. Delosario, yung mga summary nasa inyo po. Sige po, please po, pakilabas na lang po kasi may mga tungako in relation to those documents.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:53.600
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You already have a copy of that, Atty. Justin, correct?

00:16:53.780 --> 00:17:02.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor, we confirm, but Nevertheless, Your Honor, we'd just like to put on record that we haven't been given the letter dated September 10, 2016.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:06.430
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: But it's okay, Your Honor. May I proceed, Your Honor?

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:07.010
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Please proceed.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:10.130
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor. Now, hawak nyo na po yung dalawang summary?

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:12.110
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hawak ko na po.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:30.620
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, puntahan po natin yung unang summary po. Yung may informasyon tungkol sa Articles of Incorporation at ng General Information Sheet ng iba't ibang mga kumpanya. Tawagin na lang po natin yung first summary. Tama po ba na 27 pages yan? Pakicheck po.

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.350
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Composed of 27 pages.

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:37.490
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:18:00.420
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Tapos yung pangalawang summary naman po, yung isang summary rather, you confirm that ito yung containing yung title niya, Incorporators Declared in the AOI- by Company, and sa ibang pages naman, Shareholders Declared in the GIS. dash by shareholder. Inukumpirman niyo po ba?

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:01.270
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:08.340
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, you confirmed that the second summary or the summary that you are looking at now is composed of 26 pages. Tama po ba?

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:28.280
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yung pangalawang summary po ay listahan ng mga incorporators.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.630
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Correct. And it is composed of 26 pages. Yan po yung tanong ko, sir.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:32.230
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:45.620
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, you confirmed that itong dalawang mga summary na to po that came from your office and was supposedly prepared by your office are undated. or walang date. Tama po ba na nakalagay sa dokumento?

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.030
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo. Walang date.

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:55.830
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And you confirm that both these summaries that your office supposedly prepared are also unsigned or walang perma po ng kahit sa sino man. Tama po ba?

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.180
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:18:57.180 --> 00:19:09.060
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And you confirm that both these summaries that are supposedly again prepared by your office does not have a seal or even the logo of the Securities and Exchange Commission or your division. Tama po ba?

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:09.710
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:17.660
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now let's go to the letter dated September 14, 2026 that you signed. Nasa inyo na po?

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:18.700
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nasa akin na po.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:39.860
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And you confirm that in this letter it states, and I quote, and please confirm this, and I quote, To prepare a summary of general information sheet and audited financial statements of the corporations and partnerships in your letter in connection with the impeachment trial of the Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte. You confirm na may paragraph na ganyan?

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:40.540
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron po.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:20:00.640
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And the second paragraph of the same letter dated September 14, 2026 that you also signed, you confirm that it states, and I quote, the Commission respectfully transmits herewith the summaries of GIS and AFS both in electronic and hard copies format. End of quote. You confirm that?

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:01.300
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Apo.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:15.030
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, based on that document po, Atty. Del Rosario, can you please confirm that there is no mention for a request Of a summary of the articles of incorporations. Wala pong nakamention dyan. Tama po ba?

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:20.660
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po nakasulat.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:34.480
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Pasensya po, uminom lang. And you also confirm that there is also no summary, there's also no request rather, of summary of incorporators in that letter request.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.880
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po sa ang trasbital letter, wala po.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:59.320
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And you confirm, Atty. Del Rosario, that in the general information sheet naman po, Bilang isang kawaninang ating SEC, ang nare-reflect po sa GIS are the current stockholders of the corporation. At iniindicate lang whether yung current stockholders ay incorporator or hindi. Tama po ba?

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.120
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:09.880
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And it does not have a portion where the incorporators of a corporation are declared constantly unlike our articles of incorporation. Tama po ba?

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.700
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:29.490
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, despite the absence of a request for a summary of articles of incorporations or incorporators of businesses in the relevant letters, you confirm that in both your summaries, your office supposedly prepared and even included summaries of information relative to articles of incorporation, correct?

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:32.430
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: I have to object, Your Honor, because the question is misleading.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.780
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Why is it misleading, Attorney Aaron?

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:54.170
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: It is misleading, Your Honor, because Council was referring to the September 14, 2026, transmit a letter. That was not the request letter. The request letter was September 10, 2026, which clearly stated the inclusion of articles of incorporation for the summary.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:58.830
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, we're asking in relation to September 14, 2026.

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:01.030
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: If there is such a letter. If

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:04.790
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: there is such... Request with respect to those summaries.

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:09.330
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: But Your Honor, that September 14 is the transmittal letter from the SEC.

00:22:11.170 --> 00:22:20.490
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Again, if there is such a request, the problem is that the transmittal letter has not yet been furnished with the counsel for the respondent.

00:22:20.490 --> 00:22:20.810
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: That is precisely the point of

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:23.410
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: the defense, Your Honor. We were never furnished with this request.

00:22:23.410 --> 00:22:23.990
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I'll allow it.

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:27.850
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Witness may please answer. Objection overruled.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:46.900
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor. Maraming salamat po. Atorney, balikan ko lang po. Particularly po sa September 14, 2026 na sinulat ng SEC at yung pinirmahan nyo, hindi naman po sinabi doon na nag-submit kayo ng summaries ng Articles of Incorporation based on the words and those stated in that document.

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:52.580
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po, hindi nga po nakasulat sa aking transmittal letter about Articles of Incorporation.

00:22:52.920 --> 00:23:00.720
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat po, Delosario. Apologies for interrupting you. And you confirm wala ding nakasulat sa transmittal letter mo yung Incorporators, tama po ba?

00:23:00.720 --> 00:23:01.550
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po.

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:09.040
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Pero you confirm, nasa summaries na pre-repair niyo, nandun yung mga impormasyon relative to articles in corporation and in corporators, tama?

00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:13.720
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yan po yung basic na impormasyon sa bawat korporasyon, kaya naisama ko na po siya rin.

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:28.040
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, I'll take that answer, Atty. Delosario. Now, according to you, after receiving this request from the House of Representatives, you instructed members of your team or your office to work on this request, tama po ba?

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:28.690
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

00:23:28.690 --> 00:23:38.870
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At yan yung sabi niyo, kinumpirma niyo kahapon. Now, it would be correct for me to assume na itong mga empleyado na ito is under your direct supervision po.

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:39.810
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

