00:36:14.050 --> 00:36:14.730
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po.

00:36:14.730 --> 00:36:15.570
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po.

00:36:15.570 --> 00:36:25.010
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: In fact, you or the SEC do not have even personal knowledge whether those exceptions were invoked by any of those corporations. Tama po ba?

