Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, napakarami po na maaaring maging nature kung ano man yung business interest. ng isang tao in connection with the corporation. Tama po ba yan? Tama po.

01:13:04.950 --> 01:13:14.770
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So kung sakaling nakalagay po kasi dito, creditor, so kung nagpa-utang yung government official, kailangan niyang i-deklara.

01:13:16.420 --> 01:13:19.980
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo, kung pag-aari po niya, pera niya yan.

01:13:20.200 --> 01:13:24.100
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So part 2 siya ng business interest. And pati nga po kung siya ay

01:13:26.900 --> 01:13:31.020
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Nagsusupply ng services katulad ng business consultancy or

01:13:32.660 --> 01:13:42.870
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: kung abogado siya at nagsusupply siya ng legal services sa kumpanya. Ayon dito sa Section 62. Ayon po dito. Okay, salamat.

01:13:49.890 --> 01:14:05.880
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ngayon, balikan natin yung mga filing sa SEC na nabanggit kanina. Unahin po natin yung mga general information sheets. Napansin ko ho kasi na yung mga exhibits, yung mga general information sheets ay notaryado.

01:14:07.560 --> 01:14:13.190
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Tama po. Ano ho bang ibig sabihin kung yung isang dokumento ay notaryado?

01:14:15.420 --> 01:14:24.980
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ibig sabihin lang po noon na pinununumpaan niya ang bawat informasyon na nakalagay doon sa ayon sa kanyang paniniwala at nalalaman.

01:14:26.540 --> 01:14:32.980
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At in other words, kailangan totoo yung dapat nasa GIS. Tama po ba yan?

01:14:33.290 --> 01:14:33.730
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Dapat po.

01:14:34.290 --> 01:14:40.670
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ano ang consequence kung hindi man naging totoo yung mga nakalagay sa general information sheet?

01:14:41.610 --> 01:14:56.080
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Una po, may provision sa amin sa RCC na yung lawfully submitting erroneous documents, reports, violation po yan. At pangalawa, yung perjury kung ikaw ay nagsisinungaling at alam mo namang mali.

01:14:56.810 --> 01:15:02.180
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, mabigat po pala yung kaparusahan kung hindi pala totoo yung mga nakalagay sa general information sheet.

01:15:02.180 --> 01:15:02.870
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor.

01:15:02.930 --> 01:15:09.010
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Apologies. Again, with all due respect to the good counsel for the prosecutor, his once again interjected conclusions.

01:15:09.590 --> 01:15:09.650
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Move on, move

01:15:09.650 --> 01:15:09.730
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: on,

01:15:09.890 --> 01:15:10.070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: counsel.

01:15:10.850 --> 01:15:17.330
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, itong general information sheet, nabanggit niyo na ito ay, sino pong pumipirma sa GIS?

01:15:17.330 --> 01:15:20.090
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang corporate secretary po.

01:15:20.090 --> 01:15:25.115
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ang corporate secretary. At sino po ang nag-a-appoint ng corporate secretary?

01:15:25.115 --> 01:15:27.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang board of directors po.

01:15:27.200 --> 01:15:30.580
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ang board of directors. Tuwing kailan po ina-appoint ang corporate secretary?

01:15:32.360 --> 01:15:33.880
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: During the annual meeting po.

01:15:35.710 --> 01:15:40.450
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Anytime po ba pwedeng palitan ang corporate secretary ng board? Sinsila naman nag-a-appoint?

01:15:40.450 --> 01:15:44.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pag po gusto ng board, maaari po nilang gawin yan. Pwedeng palitan.

01:15:44.200 --> 01:15:47.590
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ano po yung mga instances na pwedeng mapalitan yung corporate secretary?

01:15:48.250 --> 01:16:01.800
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Siguro po isang loss of confidence. Ayaw nila yung the way mag-report. Yung compliance ng kumpanya, hindi ninyo nasasubmit. Yan po yung mga ibang paraan kung bakit papalitan siya.

01:16:03.260 --> 01:16:07.440
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Tignan nga po natin yung mga general information sheets ng Metro City Chow Foods Corporation.

01:16:13.690 --> 01:16:14.110
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: For

01:16:14.110 --> 01:16:18.930
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: the record, we are showing to the witness copies of the GIS of Metro City Chow Foods Corporation.

01:16:19.590 --> 01:16:23.910
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Standing authority for assisting counsels, the approach has been given by the presiding officer.

01:16:25.630 --> 01:16:28.690
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pakisabi po kung sino ang corporate secretary ng kumpanyang yan.

01:16:31.910 --> 01:16:33.170
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Base sa unang GIS.

01:16:35.150 --> 01:16:41.350
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa JS po ng Metro City Chow Food Corporation as of period covered is June 5, 2018.

01:16:45.730 --> 01:16:50.330
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang nakapangalan bilang corporate secretary po ay Gurley S. Delacruz.

01:16:51.290 --> 01:16:53.550
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Gurley S. Delacruz.

01:16:56.190 --> 01:16:58.390
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pakicheck nga po yung

01:17:00.050 --> 01:17:05.630
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: mga sumusunod na general information sheets kung siya pa rin po ba yung nakalagay dyan ng corporate secretary.

01:17:06.380 --> 01:17:11.510
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa May 6, 2019, Metro City Chow Food Corporation, GIS.

01:17:12.010 --> 01:17:12.770
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa

01:17:13.830 --> 01:17:22.070
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: page 11, meron pong Gurley S. Delacruz, Corporate Secretary of Metro City Chow Food Corporation.

01:17:23.320 --> 01:17:34.660
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pakitignan na lang po lahat. Lahatan na. Pakicheck po kung siya ba sa lahat ng mga general information sheets para sa mga taong 2018 hanggang 2025.

01:18:18.830 --> 01:18:23.410
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Lahat po ng GIS ay nasa pinirmahan ni Gurley Delacruz.

01:18:24.350 --> 01:18:30.310
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Napalitan po ba siya bilang corporate secretary para sa mga taong iyan, para sa kumpanyang Metro City Chow Foods?

01:18:31.550 --> 01:18:35.390
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ayon po sa dokumento, wala pong pagbabago. Maaring hindi po siya napalitan. Hindi

01:18:35.390 --> 01:18:43.510
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: siya napalitan. In fact, tama ba na actually si Gurley de la Cruz ay corporate secretary din ng iba pang mga kumpanya?

01:18:46.220 --> 01:18:48.740
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Siguro po, i-check ko lang po yung records kung...

01:18:49.380 --> 01:18:56.120
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: I think meron po tayong, or hindi man na corporate secretary, pero siya ay...

01:18:59.190 --> 01:19:08.190
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Incorporator or stockholder din, based sa nagawa ninyong summary on the table pertaining to incorporators,

01:19:10.040 --> 01:19:11.420
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: stockholders.

01:19:16.710 --> 01:19:18.550
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Meron po kayong summary na by name.

01:19:28.490 --> 01:19:37.090
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pahanap po yung pangalan ni Gurley S. De La Cruz sa inyong incorporators declared in the EOI by incorporator and I think this is on page 7,

01:19:44.210 --> 01:19:45.510
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: 2026.

01:19:49.100 --> 01:20:00.940
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ando na po ba kayo? Sa page 7 of 2026, sa pangalan ng Gurley S. De La Cruz. So based po dyan, incorporator po siya para sa mga aling kumpanya.

01:20:01.910 --> 01:20:18.830
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ayon po dito, si Gurley S. De La Cruz ay incorporator ng Davao New Royal Taipan Foods Corporation, GenCorp Industries, JTC Group of Companies Philippines, Metro City Chow Food Corporation,

01:20:21.340 --> 01:20:22.360
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: B-Food Corporation.

01:20:23.460 --> 01:20:27.960
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. So, Incorporator din po siya sa limang kumpanyang nabanggit niyo.

01:20:38.210 --> 01:20:47.810
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: To clarify, ito yung Andrew Lozario, limang kumpanya lang po? MetroCity Chow, GenCorp, Times Square, B-Foods, Davao New Royal, and JTC?

01:20:48.910 --> 01:20:56.330
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. Davao New Royal, GenCorp, JTC Group of Companies, MetroCity Chow, at Times Square B.

01:20:56.510 --> 01:20:58.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Doon lang po siya shareholder?

01:20:58.560 --> 01:20:59.840
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Incorporator po.

01:20:59.840 --> 01:21:02.610
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Incorporator. Incorporator lang po.

01:21:10.380 --> 01:21:11.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Proceed, counsel.

01:21:11.680 --> 01:21:28.540
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, your honor. Ngayon, pinag-usapan din ang articles of incorporation. Ah, sorry, ang audited financial statements. Kanina, no, na-bring up po. Ano po ba ang ibig sabihin kung ang financial statements ay audited?

01:21:30.350 --> 01:21:31.730
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Asking for opinion, your honor.

01:21:33.130 --> 01:21:38.290
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: If he knows, counsel, he receives the submissions. He should know what it means.

01:21:39.500 --> 01:21:53.880
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ang audited financial statement po ay yung structured data about financial condition ng isang korporasyon kung saan na ito ay sinuri pa ng isang external auditor. Malaman kung ang mga accounting standards ay nasunod.

01:21:55.260 --> 01:21:59.660
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Kanina po galing yung financial information na nakalagay sa audited FS?

01:22:00.080 --> 01:22:00.700
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nanggaling

01:22:00.700 --> 01:22:04.040
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: po sa kumpanya. And then, ano po ang gagawin ng external auditor?

01:22:04.500 --> 01:22:10.790
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ibabalidate po niya kung ang mga information is in accordance with the Proscribed accounting standards.

01:22:12.910 --> 01:22:20.930
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Punta nga tayo sa isang example ng audited financial statements.

01:22:40.230 --> 01:22:58.340
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Particularly, Your Honor, we would like to show Exhibit P-R2-2-6-2-H which is the audited financial statements for the year 2024.

01:23:07.150 --> 01:23:09.390
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: For Metro City Chow Foods Corporation.

01:23:37.720 --> 01:23:38.920
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hawak ko na po.

01:23:38.920 --> 01:23:45.040
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Hawak niyo na. Ngayon, puntahan niyo yung page 4 ng audited financial statements.

01:23:58.670 --> 01:24:00.990
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, ando na po ba kayo sa page 4?

01:24:02.540 --> 01:24:07.340
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Nando na po. Ano yung title ng document na lumalabas dyan sa page 4?

01:24:08.440 --> 01:24:13.080
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ito po yung Statement of Management Responsibility for Financial Statements.

01:24:13.550 --> 01:24:17.910
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pwede ba natin basahin yung first paragraph ng statement na yan?

01:24:21.230 --> 01:24:46.610
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po dito sa SMR ng Metro City Chow Food Corporation, the management of Metro City Chow Food Corporation is responsible for the preparation and fair presentation of the financial statement for the years ended December 31, 2024 and 2023 in accordance with the prescribed financial reporting framework indicated therein.

01:24:47.230 --> 01:24:47.610
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: And

01:24:47.610 --> 01:24:58.330
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: for such internal control, as punishment determined is necessary to enable the preparation of financial statement that are free from material statement whether due to fraud or error.

01:25:00.170 --> 01:25:08.740
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Sige po. Punta po tayo sa pangatlo na paragraph. Ano pong sinasabi sa linyang yan?

01:25:09.340 --> 01:25:15.000
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: The board of directors is responsible for overseeing the company's financial reporting process.

01:25:15.640 --> 01:25:18.400
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: How about yung susunod po na linya? Pakibasa po.

01:25:19.240 --> 01:25:27.100
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: The Board of Directors review and approve the financial statements and submit the same to the stockholders. To the what po?

01:25:28.020 --> 01:25:29.880
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Stockholders po. Stockholders.

01:25:31.790 --> 01:25:36.110
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Napansin ko po na notaryado itong Statement of Management Responsibility.

01:25:37.790 --> 01:25:38.730
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Tama po ba?

01:25:39.030 --> 01:25:39.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Oo, may notary po.

01:25:40.110 --> 01:25:43.590
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, sworn statement din po ito kung ganun?

01:25:45.680 --> 01:25:46.380
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Oo po,

01:25:46.380 --> 01:25:47.320
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: yun po ang nakalagay.

01:25:47.480 --> 01:25:52.280
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, ano po ba itong Statement of Management Responsibility? At bakit po ito kailangan?

01:25:53.190 --> 01:26:18.430
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Isa po ito sa mga, well, requirement para tanggapin namin ang financial statement ng isang kumpanya. Kasama nga narin po rito yung unang binanggit kahapon about the stamp, the receiving ng BAR. Ito po yung pangalawa na tinitingnan namin na dapat maging parte ng financial statement. Ang nagsasabi na ang accountability dito ay ang board of trustees o directors.

01:26:19.130 --> 01:26:21.150
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ano po ulit? Ang accountability ay?

01:26:21.980 --> 01:26:23.320
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang board of directors po.

01:26:23.440 --> 01:26:24.640
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So sila po ang accountable?

01:26:24.780 --> 01:26:27.440
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Base rin po sa nakasulat dito.

01:26:29.430 --> 01:26:34.690
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ngayon, puntahan natin yung notes dyan sa financial statements na iyan.

01:26:45.330 --> 01:26:47.030
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Punta tayo sa page 13.

01:27:03.530 --> 01:27:07.250
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Page 13, nandun po ba kayo? Note 1, corporate information?

01:27:09.180 --> 01:27:09.620
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

01:27:13.400 --> 01:27:18.480
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pwede ba nating basahin yung second paragraph ng note 1 na iyan?

01:27:22.890 --> 01:27:39.080
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po sa second paragraph nito, the accompanying financial statements of the company as at and for the day, years 2024 and 2023 were approved and authorized by its Board of Directors on March 31, 2025.

01:27:42.760 --> 01:27:43.540
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ano po

01:27:43.540 --> 01:27:44.140
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: ang ibig sabihin

01:27:44.140 --> 01:27:56.090
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: na yan? Ibig sabihin lang po nito ay yung financial statement nito ay inaproobahan at inauthorized ng Board of Directors sa Petyang March 31, 2025.

01:27:57.780 --> 01:27:58.420
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank

01:27:59.310 --> 01:28:07.270
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: you. At ano ko ang interest ulit o role ni VP Sara sa Metro City Chow Foods Corporation?

01:28:09.080 --> 01:28:16.660
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. Hasn't answered. And already answered that he has no personal knowledge.

01:28:17.940 --> 01:28:21.620
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: No, on Metro Chow. Based on the documents submitted. Yes, sir.

01:28:23.250 --> 01:28:24.470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Witness may answer?

01:28:24.730 --> 01:28:42.300
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po sa general information sheet ng Metro City Chow Foods Corporation from 2018 to 2025 nag-a-appear po na si VP Sara Duterte po ay member of the Board of Directors at stockholder ng nasabing kumpanya.

01:28:45.400 --> 01:28:46.340
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you.

01:28:48.600 --> 01:28:55.900
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At based po sa Section 22 ng Revised Corporation Code, ano pa ang sinasabi ng section na ito tungkol sa Board of Directors?

01:28:58.640 --> 01:29:01.140
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ang Board of Directors po ang

01:29:02.980 --> 01:29:05.680
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Siya po ang section

01:29:09.330 --> 01:29:11.450
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: 22 po is about

01:29:11.450 --> 01:29:20.470
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Maaari ko ba kayong bigyan ng kopya ng revised corporation code section 2020 ah para mabasa niyo ang section 22.

01:29:21.350 --> 01:29:24.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: To exercise corporate powers yung post siguro yan.

01:29:33.510 --> 01:29:35.050
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: First paragraph lang ako.

01:29:38.620 --> 01:29:46.180
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: For the record, assisting counsel is showing Attorney Del Rosario a copy of the revised corporation code RCC for brevity.

01:29:52.910 --> 01:29:59.490
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Section 22 of RCC, the Board of Directors or Trustee of the Corporation, Qualification.

01:30:11.100 --> 01:30:11.980
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: So

01:30:20.520 --> 01:30:23.000
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: anong ibig sabihin niyang nabasa ninyo?

01:30:27.940 --> 01:30:28.820
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: So

01:30:31.760 --> 01:30:39.660
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: may

01:30:39.660 --> 01:30:43.020
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: control ang board sa properties na mapuba?

01:30:43.310 --> 01:30:44.190
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

01:30:53.630 --> 01:31:03.950
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Meron po ba kayong natanggap? Tinatanong po kanina na itong mga GIS or AFS ay mga filings galing sa corporations. Tama po ba?

01:31:04.370 --> 01:31:04.990
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:31:05.790 --> 01:31:16.390
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Nakatanggap po ba kayo ever ng any information mula sa mga kumpanya based sa mga sinertify nyo na documents na may mali o may dapat baguhin sa mga nakadeklara doon?

01:31:19.690 --> 01:31:30.620
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: With respect po sa request for Correction. Wala po. Pero meron pong amendments. Hindi ko lang po alam kung dahil sa pagkakamali o meron lang po silang i-update.

01:31:31.100 --> 01:31:34.540
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. So that would be all for Redirect, Your Honor.

01:31:34.760 --> 01:31:36.260
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Henry Cross, Maturin Justin.

01:31:39.080 --> 01:31:41.180
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sorry, Your Honor. Just a few questions.

01:31:43.130 --> 01:31:55.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: First, kanina sa Redirect examination, kinumpirman niyo na ang audited financial statement ay aprobado ng Board of Directors. Tama po ba? Ayon po sa nakasulat sa financial statement

01:31:55.950 --> 01:31:56.590
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ng kumpanya.

01:31:56.790 --> 01:32:01.650
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Pero hindi din naman kayo aware whether nag-participate yung vice-presidente sa pag-aproba nito?

01:32:02.920 --> 01:32:09.080
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, on personal knowledge, kung merong nangyaring ganito, hindi po namin alam but we just rely on what is written in the document.

01:32:09.360 --> 01:32:17.180
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: In fact, quorum lang naman po yung required para ma-approve yung audited financial statement. Hindi kailangan lahat ng director. Tama po ba? Depende

01:32:17.180 --> 01:32:25.040
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po sa provision nila sa articles. Kung kinakailangan ng higher quorum, then they should respect the higher quorum. Correct. Pero kung basic na basic, it should be majority.

01:32:25.960 --> 01:32:33.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat. Naupuntahan po natin yung eleksyon ng corporate secretary. Ito po ay ginagawa sa ating organizational meeting. Tama po ba?

01:32:33.920 --> 01:32:34.800
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:32:34.800 --> 01:32:40.380
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At hindi nyo rin po alam whether nag-participate yung vice-presidente sa organizational meeting.

01:32:40.380 --> 01:32:41.190
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:32:41.190 --> 01:32:49.070
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At pwede naman po na hindi lahat ng mga stockholder or board of directors mag-participate sa mga annual meetings. Tama po ba?

01:32:49.070 --> 01:32:49.705
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:32:49.705 --> 01:32:53.100
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Last question, kilala niyo ba si Gurley de la Cruz personally?

01:32:53.100 --> 01:32:54.190
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hindi po.

01:32:54.190 --> 01:32:54.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: No further questions.

01:32:57.710 --> 01:33:15.630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: We now proceed to the interjections of Senator Judges. Hopefully, we can finish with the Attorney de la Rosaria before lunch and move on to the next witness, Mr. Supena, when we resume after lunch. The first to register is Senator Judge Erwin Tulfo.

01:33:19.580 --> 01:33:21.620
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You have two minutes, sir. You may proceed when you're ready.

01:33:24.270 --> 01:33:37.980
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Ito po sa ating testigo. Mr. Witness, itong JTC Group of Companies, ito po ba yung ibig sabihin po ng JTC's Jaime Tan Cruz?

01:33:40.480 --> 01:33:47.560
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala pong disclosure sa Articles of Incorporation under the corporate name na JTC stands for Jaime T. Cruz.

01:33:47.820 --> 01:33:48.260
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

01:33:50.160 --> 01:34:03.160
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: May mga nakikita po ba kayo sa inyong dokumento po sa SEC? na either Incorporator or Board of Director si Jaime Tan Cruz sa City Hall King Chow Foods Corporation.

01:34:04.700 --> 01:34:06.800
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Silipin ko lang po sandali yung aking notes.

01:34:06.800 --> 01:34:07.320
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Sige po.

01:34:33.280 --> 01:34:34.220
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron po.

01:34:34.220 --> 01:34:42.080
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alright. Sa Metro City Chow Foods Corporation, lumalabas diba ang pangalan ng Jaime Tan Cruz?

01:34:43.210 --> 01:34:49.990
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Lumalabas po yung pangalan ni Jaime T. Cruz sa Metro City Chow Food Corporation based po sa Articles of Incorporation. Sa

01:34:49.990 --> 01:34:56.170
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Great Jolly Times Food Corporation, nandyan din ba ang pangalan ni Jaime Tan Cruz?

01:34:56.170 --> 01:34:57.480
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nandyan din po.

01:34:57.480 --> 01:35:03.910
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Sa Dabao New Royal Taipan Foods Corporation, nandyan din ba ang pangalan ni Jaime Tan Cruz?

01:35:03.910 --> 01:35:05.115
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nandyan po.

01:35:05.115 --> 01:35:10.740
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Sa Dabao Emerging Taipans Corporation, nandyan din ba ang pangalan niya?

01:35:10.740 --> 01:35:12.080
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nandyan din po.

01:35:12.080 --> 01:35:19.080
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Sa Davao Bounty Times Food Corporation, nag-a-appear din ba ang pangalan niya dyan?

01:35:19.080 --> 01:35:20.820
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nandun din po ang pangalan niya.

01:35:20.820 --> 01:35:30.020
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay. Dito sa JCT Group of Companies, lumalabas ba na Jaime Tan Cruz ang chairman po nito?

01:35:37.340 --> 01:35:44.180
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Assisting counsel, kindly assist Atty. Del Rosario, JTC.

01:35:52.690 --> 01:36:13.380
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Just to remind Senator-Judge Irwin, the reason why the witness is having a difficult time is because both JTC and Pikimon Corporations were not subpoenaed by the court because the name of the Vice President does not appear.

01:36:13.800 --> 01:36:14.520
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Yes, sir.

01:36:14.860 --> 01:36:18.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: as one of the shareholders in the GIS of that corporation. And

01:36:18.560 --> 01:36:19.080
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: as you correctly

01:36:19.080 --> 01:36:22.220
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: pointed out, JTC might mean that person that you're mentioning.

01:36:22.360 --> 01:36:31.080
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay, well, anyway, I'll move on, Mr. Presiding Officer. Then, let me ask our prosecutor.

01:36:34.510 --> 01:36:39.950
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Maybe he can answer this or any of the members of the prosecution team.

01:36:43.320 --> 01:37:09.820
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Mr. Prosecutor, Ito po bang si Jaime Tan Cruz? Is this the same person? Basi po sa inyong pag-iimbestiga po dito po sa House Prosecution. Ito po bang Jaime Tan Cruz na ito is the same person na na-appoint mo po na dating Pangulong Duterte as a special envoy to China for trade and investment?

01:37:10.440 --> 01:37:14.000
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor. The same name, Your Honor. Same person. Is

01:37:14.000 --> 01:37:22.900
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: he the same person na inoferan po ng dating Pangulong Duterte na maging chairman po ng PhilHealth pero tinanggihan niya po?

01:37:23.340 --> 01:37:24.240
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor.

01:37:24.680 --> 01:37:35.520
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: If I'm not mistaken, tama po ba October 2019 po nung siya po ay na-appoint bilang Special Envoy to China for Trade and Investment?

01:37:36.000 --> 01:37:39.420
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: I'm not sure about the date but he was appointed, Your Honor.

01:37:39.740 --> 01:37:52.460
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: And then after that, tinanggihan niya na po after he stinted as an envoy, inoperan po siya bilang chairman po ng PhilHealth pero he denied or he did not accept.

01:37:52.800 --> 01:37:54.020
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: I believe so, Your Honor.

01:37:54.160 --> 01:37:57.190
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: So this is one and the same person, is that correct?

01:37:57.190 --> 01:37:57.870
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yes, Your Honor.

01:37:57.870 --> 01:38:01.000
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: I have no further questions, Mr. Presiding Officer.

01:38:01.560 --> 01:38:06.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator-Judge Rafi Tulfo is recognized for his interjection.

01:38:11.030 --> 01:38:13.010
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may proceed when you're ready, sir. You have two minutes.

01:38:16.910 --> 01:38:22.315
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Mr. Witness, are you familiar with the Securities Regulation Code RA 8799?

01:38:22.315 --> 01:38:24.030
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo.

01:38:24.030 --> 01:38:30.640
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Under the Securities Regulation Code, anong definition ng securities doon?

01:38:31.780 --> 01:38:53.810
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Napakalawak po ng definition ng securities. Kabilang na rin po dyan yung securities po tulad po ng shares of stock o anumang intangible na pwedeng ibigay as investment. Isang produkto ng investment. Maaring investment contract na forms under the ambit of securities po.

01:38:57.110 --> 01:38:59.290
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Tama po. Securities po yan.

01:39:03.210 --> 01:39:04.210
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Tama po.

01:39:17.580 --> 01:39:36.870
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So, ayon sa Article 7, Section 13, bawal sa isang government official tulad ng VP o presidente na magkaroon ng participation in any company. Ayon po sa nakasaad sa ating Constitution. That's violation of the Constitution, right? Opo. Thank you. That's all.

01:39:37.660 --> 01:39:40.980
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator-Judge Tulfo. The Senate President is recognized.

01:39:43.430 --> 01:39:43.910
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: You

01:39:43.910 --> 01:39:45.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: have two minutes, sir. You may proceed when you're ready.

01:39:45.450 --> 01:39:50.290
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you. Thank you very much, Mr. Presiding Officer. Good morning, Atty. Delosario.

01:39:50.290 --> 01:39:50.900
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Good morning.

01:39:50.900 --> 01:39:53.810
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Good morning sa aking kababayan na taga-Valenzuela.

01:39:54.430 --> 01:39:55.490
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Magandang umaga po.

01:39:57.430 --> 01:40:03.830
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Atty., tinitignan ko pa itong summary na pinadala ninyo or ang ginawa ninyo.

01:40:05.700 --> 01:40:17.860
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tama po ba na sa lahat po ng mga corporations na may kaugnayan kay Vice President Sara at kay Manassas Carpio, wala pong ni isa nag-declare ng dividends?

01:40:18.960 --> 01:40:22.580
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. Wala pong informasyon kung nag-deklara sila ng dividendo.

01:40:22.820 --> 01:40:34.120
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Okay. So, ibig sabihin kung merong, kung babangga po namin ito sa SAL-N, hindi po pwedeng manggaling sa mga corporations niya yung paglaki ng kanyang net worth.

01:40:36.240 --> 01:40:43.400
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tama po ba? Dahil kung by process of elimination, titignan natin yung mga corporations, pwede na nating i-rule out yung corporations.

01:40:44.350 --> 01:40:52.770
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kung ayon po rito at wala po siyang natanggap na beneficiary yung dividendo, hindi ko po alam kung mayroon po siyang may dideklarang kinita out of this company.

01:40:53.110 --> 01:40:58.510
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Correct. Pwede sa ibang source. Hindi lang dito sa corporations.

01:40:58.510 --> 01:40:59.660
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:40:59.660 --> 01:41:02.570
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tapos tinitignan ko rin po yung mga corporations.

01:41:04.810 --> 01:41:11.290
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Maliban sa GenCorp, Davao Emerging Taipans, SGT Fortune Horse,

01:41:13.950 --> 01:41:16.670
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Mati Ice Plant. Halos lahat po ay lugi.

01:41:18.340 --> 01:41:26.940
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tama po. Itong kaso lang, ito si GenCorp, hindi naman po shareholder on record si Vice President Sara.

01:41:27.200 --> 01:41:28.400
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po sa GenCorp.

01:41:28.660 --> 01:41:50.990
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So yung may connection lang kay Atty. Manases at kay Vice President Sara ay Mati Ice Plant, Davao Merging Taipan, sa SGT. Ito lang yung kumita. The rest, tinitignan ko dito sa summary, lugi po siya. Tama po. And therefore, hindi ho makakadeclare ng dividends dahil lugi nga eh.

01:41:51.630 --> 01:41:56.630
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yung pong mga deficit ang retained earnings po, hindi po makakapag-declare ng dividendo.

01:41:56.630 --> 01:41:56.830
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Correct.

01:41:56.950 --> 01:41:59.450
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Kakain pa nga yan sa capital niya. Tama

01:41:59.450 --> 01:41:59.630
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po.

01:42:00.970 --> 01:42:10.990
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Yung mga corporations na hindi ho nagde-declare, ito, I'll jump to another topic. Yung mga corporations na hindi ho nagpa-file ng GIS,

01:42:13.000 --> 01:42:23.780
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: EFS, yung audited financial statements. Hindi niyo ba pinapenalize yan sa inyong departamento dahil importanteng mga source of information to?

01:42:24.990 --> 01:42:48.280
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yan po ay isang trabaho ng aking departamento, i-monitor yung kailang compliance na kung saan kung ang korporasyon, stockman o non-stock ay hindi nakapagsubmitin ang nasabing report, pinapadala po namin sila ng notice to submit. At kung magpapatuloy na hindi sila magsubmit na report, maaari po namin i-revoke yung kanilang Certificate of Registration.

01:42:48.440 --> 01:43:04.780
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: May mga nakita ko ang corporations dito na matagal nang hindi na sasubmit. Meron ba kayong pinadang letter sa kanila para i-compel sila magsubmit? At kung meron, anong action? At kung wala, meron ba kayong mga penalties na i-impose dito sa mga corporations?

01:43:06.260 --> 01:43:14.060
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron po. In fact, may dala po ako rito yung monitoring sheet about their violations.

01:43:15.830 --> 01:43:32.960
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kapag notified po ang JS, pati na rin po ang financial statement, meron po akong hawak dito. At yung iba naman po sa mga nasabing korporasyon ay na-rebalk na namin o dili kaya ay nagpa-dissolve na sila. o nag-shorten ang corporate term.

01:43:36.760 --> 01:43:37.280
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Meron

01:43:37.280 --> 01:43:37.380
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po

01:43:37.380 --> 01:43:37.540
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: ako.

01:43:44.210 --> 01:43:46.390
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Yung kasama

01:43:46.390 --> 01:43:57.490
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po sa pangalan ng mga kumpanya ito ay itong CYKNT Davao Corporation. Narevoke po namin ito noong 2018 dahil hindi po nagsasubmit ng report.

01:43:59.790 --> 01:44:10.770
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ito pong SGT Fortune Horse Corporation. Nag-shorten na po ito ng corporate term. Ang buhay po nila hanggang July 29, 2017 na lang po.

01:44:12.350 --> 01:44:15.320
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: At mayroon pa pong isa.

01:44:17.830 --> 01:44:26.630
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ito pong Three Kids Racking Services Incorporated na nag-shorten din po ng kanyang term until July 24, 2017.

01:44:27.230 --> 01:44:35.820
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So ito mga ito ay by... Dahil po sa mandato ninyo, sila po ay na-revoke na yung kanilang incorporation.

01:44:36.060 --> 01:44:41.420
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yung isa po, yung dalawa po, sila po mismo ang kusang nag-file ng application to shorten the corporate term.

01:44:41.580 --> 01:44:49.430
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So, obviously, hindi rin ito pwede maging source ng income sa paglaki ng net worth ni VP Sara.

01:44:49.430 --> 01:44:50.280
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:44:50.280 --> 01:44:52.160
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

01:44:53.710 --> 01:45:06.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator-Judge Hontiveros is recognized. You may proceed, ma'am, when you're ready. There is no one else except for me, though. A Senator-Judge Pangilinan din before Senator-Judge Hontiveros.

01:45:07.660 --> 01:45:08.180
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You

01:45:08.180 --> 01:45:12.200
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: may proceed, sir, when you're ready. You have two minutes. Thereafter, Senator-Judge Hontiveros.

01:45:13.400 --> 01:45:14.060
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Thank you

01:45:14.060 --> 01:45:14.260
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: very much.

01:45:14.260 --> 01:45:14.580
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Let's try to

01:45:14.580 --> 01:45:16.630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: wrap up with this witness before lunch.

01:45:16.630 --> 01:45:18.860
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Magandang umaga, Attorney...

01:45:18.860 --> 01:45:20.080
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Magandang umaga po.

01:45:20.080 --> 01:45:30.410
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: ...Del Rosario. Tama ba na doon sa GIS ng GenCorp ay ang kumpanyang JTC Group ay

01:45:32.280 --> 01:45:34.780
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Nasa list ng shareholders.

01:46:06.620 --> 01:46:18.620
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ayon po sa 2025 GIS ng GenCorp Industries Inc., si JTC Group of Companies po ay shareholders ng nasabing korporasyon.

01:46:18.800 --> 01:46:27.250
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: At ilang porsyento ng shares ang pag-aari ng JTC Group sa GenCorp?

01:46:27.850 --> 01:46:32.390
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon po rito meron po siyang 54.99% ownership.

01:46:32.850 --> 01:46:39.350
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: So majority ng GENCORP is owned by JTC?

01:46:39.350 --> 01:46:41.300
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. Ayon po dito.

01:46:41.300 --> 01:46:51.730
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Okay. Hindi ba may requirement ng disclosure as to sino talaga ang may control ng GENCORP sa SEC?

01:46:52.460 --> 01:46:58.945
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yan po yung mga, yung pong informasyon na yan ay nakasaad sa ating, sa aming BO declaration form.

01:46:58.945 --> 01:47:00.630
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Ano yung BO?

01:47:00.630 --> 01:47:02.090
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Beneficial Ownership

01:47:02.090 --> 01:47:02.580
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Declaration.

01:47:02.580 --> 01:47:04.750
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: So, required yan?

01:47:04.750 --> 01:47:05.900
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kailangan po.

01:47:05.900 --> 01:47:14.940
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: So, would you have that document? Sino ang beneficial owner ng JTC Corporation?

01:47:15.790 --> 01:47:22.690
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Gaya po nang nasabi ko, sinusubite po yan sa SEC pero wala po sa aming pangangalaga sa aking departamento ang kopya na yan.

01:47:22.890 --> 01:47:36.840
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: So, in other words, based on the documents, ang JTC Corporation ang majority stockholder ng GenCorp.

01:47:36.840 --> 01:47:38.445
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:47:38.445 --> 01:47:44.160
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Para lang sa ating mga kababayan, pag majority stockholder ka,

01:47:46.970 --> 01:47:54.815
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Ano ang mga kapangyarihan na meron ka bilang majority stockholder ng isang kumpanya?

01:47:54.815 --> 01:47:57.860
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron po kayong guaranteed seat sa board.

01:48:00.380 --> 01:48:01.080
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Mataas

01:48:01.080 --> 01:48:03.420
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ang iyong dibidendo kung meron po mang dideklara.

01:48:15.490 --> 01:48:27.070
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Gawa po ng malaking porsyento rin po yung board na maaari mong ilagay sa board directors. Malaking porsyento din po about control or decision

01:48:27.070 --> 01:48:28.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ang magagawa mo.

01:48:28.200 --> 01:48:35.410
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: So pwede mong tanggalin ang presidente with 54% of the votes of the shares at palitan?

01:48:35.410 --> 01:48:37.190
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kung presidente po, opo.

01:48:37.190 --> 01:48:41.045
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Pwede rin palitan ang members of the board?

01:48:41.045 --> 01:48:43.350
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Meron pong required votes na two-thirds.

01:48:43.350 --> 01:48:52.940
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Yes, tama. Two-thirds pagka Board of Directors. Pero yung Presidente, Treasurer, pwede ng majority.

01:48:55.030 --> 01:48:58.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. Ang Presidente, solong na hindi mo siya tatanggalin as member of the Board.

01:48:59.150 --> 01:49:12.370
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Yes. So in other words, JTC na ang beneficial owner or ang major shareholder ng GenCorp, pwede palitan. Yung presidente ng GENCO.

01:49:12.370 --> 01:49:13.490
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:49:13.490 --> 01:49:38.280
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Okay. Hindi ba dapat, well, I will leave that to the presiding officer, but perhaps at this time, we should be able to subpoena the records, should we, after the presentation, of course, of both panels, the corporate documents and records of JTC.

01:49:40.150 --> 01:49:46.010
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: But I will address that or we will tackle that later on.

01:49:49.940 --> 01:50:00.400
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The chair will take it under advisement and shall await action emanating from the panel of prosecutors, Senator-Judge Pangilinan. Thank you. And will act accordingly thereafter.

01:50:01.470 --> 01:50:03.170
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: So kung

01:50:05.450 --> 01:50:11.320
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: ang JTC ay stockholder ng GenCorp, kailangan,

01:50:15.770 --> 01:50:31.920
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: yes, just to place it on record, we must Know who JTC, who the stockholders are of JTC because they ultimately control or at least through, I mean GenCorp.

01:50:33.870 --> 01:50:34.490
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Okay.

01:50:36.580 --> 01:50:49.440
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Tama ba na sa GenCorp, stockholder ang City Hall, may mga officers at stockholders ng GenCorp na sila rin ay nasa City Hall Chow Foods Corporation?

01:50:51.300 --> 01:50:52.160
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Just to...

01:50:54.370 --> 01:50:57.150
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ayon

01:51:21.730 --> 01:51:29.350
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: po sa GS ng GenCorp, maging ang City Chow Food Corporation, meron po silang common stockholders.

01:51:30.640 --> 01:51:46.830
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Yes, so City Corp, City Hall, King Chow Foods at GenCorp. Just to wrap up, pati ang Metro City Chow Foods, iba pa yun, meron ding stockholder ang GenCorp sa Metro City

01:51:46.830 --> 01:51:49.550
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Chow Food. Sa Metro City po meron po.

01:51:49.770 --> 01:52:02.800
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: At meron din sa... Okay. So yung dalawang yun, no? City Hall at Metro ay mayroong shareholders, common shareholders and officers with GenCorp.

01:52:02.980 --> 01:52:06.520
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po. City Hall, Metro and... City

01:52:06.650 --> 01:52:08.220
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Hall, Metro and GenCorp.

01:52:08.220 --> 01:52:13.340
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: And GenCorp is majority shareholder is JTC.

01:52:13.340 --> 01:52:14.400
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:52:14.400 --> 01:52:17.990
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Okay. No other questions at this first round,

01:52:18.030 --> 01:52:18.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Mr. President?

01:52:18.570 --> 01:52:19.310
Sen. Francis Pangilinan: Thank you. Thank

01:52:19.310 --> 01:52:23.070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: you, Senator-Judge Pangilinan. Senator-Judge Hontiveros.

01:52:31.490 --> 01:52:35.730
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Salamat po, Mr. Presiding Officer. Magandang umaga po muli, Atty. Del Rosario.

01:52:36.010 --> 01:52:36.910
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Magandang umaga po, ma'am.

01:52:37.840 --> 01:52:51.870
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Sir, ayon po sa mga records ng SEC, paano niyo po malalaman kung magkano ang binayad ni VP Duterte at o ng asawa niya para sa mga shares sa isang kumpanya?

01:52:53.560 --> 01:53:00.510
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ang information lamang po na Masasabi namin kung magkano ay kung ano ang nakatala sa kanyang Articles of Incorporation.

01:53:01.530 --> 01:53:05.930
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So malalaman po ng SEC yun kung sa Articles of Incorporation.

01:53:05.930 --> 01:53:13.430
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yung figure po na nakalagay as paid up capital, yun po yung alam kong parte ng kanyang binayad na investment. Under

01:53:13.430 --> 01:53:15.250
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: paid up capital.

01:53:15.810 --> 01:53:16.410
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

01:53:16.730 --> 01:53:16.990
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay.

01:53:18.750 --> 01:53:26.030
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Posible po ba na mas malaki ang binayad niya o nila kesa sa par value ng shares na yun?

01:53:27.450 --> 01:53:31.870
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nangyayari naman po na merong additional paid-in capital.

01:53:32.490 --> 01:53:33.130
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Pero

01:53:33.130 --> 01:53:40.310
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: base po sa dokumentong ito, wala naman po nagpapakita na meron siyang APIC. Na merong? APIC, yung additional paid-in capital.

01:53:41.270 --> 01:53:46.090
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay. So, hindi nyo ito makikita kahit saan?

01:53:46.810 --> 01:54:02.450
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Sa disclosure po during incorporation, dapat po nakasaad na kung merong siyang premium o APIC. Dahil yan din po ang basehan kung magkano rin po yung dapat bayaran ng kumpanya sa pagpaparehisto ng korporasyon sa amin.

01:54:02.650 --> 01:54:10.550
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So kung hindi po nakalagay yung APIC o yung premium, hindi nyo po makikita? Opo. Okay po.

01:54:12.240 --> 01:54:31.680
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kapag naman po may isang public official na siya mismo ang nagdeklara sa kanyang salin na meron siyang interest sa isang kumpanya, Pero yung pangalan niya ay hindi po nag-a-appear doon sa GIS bilang stockholder.

01:54:33.390 --> 01:54:40.890
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Hindi ba yun precisely isang bagay yun na dapat tignan o i-review, mag-take action ng SEC?

01:54:43.220 --> 01:54:51.120
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Unang-una po ma'am, wala po kaming access on the SAL-N. Therefore, hindi po namin alam kung yung mga kumpanyang in

01:54:51.120 --> 01:54:54.060
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: -list niya roon ay talagang kabilang siya.

01:54:56.080 --> 01:55:13.800
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So, paano po ba tinatrato itong ganitong sitwasyon ng inyong ahensya na wala yung pangalan ng isang opisyal bilang stockholder sa GIS pero na pag-aalaman ninyo na siya mismo inilagay yung pangalan niya sa SAL-N?

01:55:15.520 --> 01:55:52.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po kami magiging action dyan. Gawa po ng base sa record namin, hindi naman po talaga siya stockholder. Ngayon, kung meron po siyang allegation sa kanyang SAL-N na Stockholder siya dito pero wala siyang proof on the registration document sa amin. Siguro po, ibang ahensya po siguro dapat mag-investiga on that. Dahil ang mandato lang po namin ay improve ang capital market. In fact, ang mahalaga nga po sa amin ay yung corporate formations na kaya hinihikayat nga po namin sila na magtayo ng kumpanya sa Pilipinas.

01:55:54.230 --> 01:56:03.410
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Aling ibang ahensya ang dapat mag-imbestiga kung may ganitong sitwasyon na official mismo magsabi sa SAL-N niya kahit wala siya doon sa GIS?

01:56:04.250 --> 01:56:32.630
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Una po ang SAL-N ay sinusumiti po, ang alam ko, sa Ombudsman. Kaya para nga sa akin po, yung provision sa Constitution, sila rin po sigurang tumingin. Dahil yung provision na po ito, alam ko, hindi naman dapat ipatupad ng ahensya kundi sarili niya mismo alam niya dapat. kung ano yung restriction sa kanya. Ayon sa pagkakaunawa niya sa definisyon dun sa Section 7, Article 7, Section 13.

01:56:33.430 --> 01:56:42.050
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kung inilagay sa SAL-N kahit wala siya sa GIS, maituturing ba yan na admission against interest?

01:56:46.380 --> 01:56:51.370
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Admission against interest. Sa akin po, interest nga po yun eh.

01:56:56.370 --> 01:57:17.720
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: And ano naman po yung ginagawa ng SEC para makita Kung may indirect ownership, beneficial ownership, nominee arrangement, intermediary o iba pang layer ng corporate ownership sa mga kumpanya na isinusumite sa inyo sa mga dokumento.

01:57:17.920 --> 01:57:29.600
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Iyon nga pong beneficial ownership form. Yun po ang magsisilbing reporting sa amin upang malaman kung sino talaga yung ultimate ownership which should be na dapat ay natural person.

01:57:31.790 --> 01:57:31.910
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: At

01:57:31.910 --> 01:57:40.260
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: maiwasan din po yung mga corporate layering at maipakita rin sino ba talaga ang may control nung nasabing shares of stock.

01:57:41.640 --> 01:58:00.900
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So dun lamang po sa beneficial ownership form, yun lamang po yung magagawa ninyo para makita kung sino talaga ang nagmamayari at sino talagang nakikinabang sa mga nakadeklara sa mga dokumentong sinusumite sa inyo. Tama po ma'am.

01:58:01.080 --> 01:58:01.780
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay.

01:58:03.740 --> 01:58:04.420
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So

01:58:12.610 --> 01:58:21.690
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: baka huli po Atty. Del Rosario, ano po yung effect ng isang undeclared beneficial ownership sa pananaw po ng SEC?

01:58:23.100 --> 01:58:27.820
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, alam ko po ay nire-review rin po siya ng aming Enforcement Department.

01:58:29.500 --> 01:59:02.170
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Ibabase po sa mga submission nila. Kasi kailangan po talagang isubmit yan. We require them to submit fruitful beneficial ownership declaration. Kaya po minomorder din po siya ng aming enforcement department kung natugunan po ng kumpanya ang tamang disclosure. Kung ano po ang penalty, medyo hindi ko po kayang sagutin kung it will revoke the company or what or meron mang monetary penalty dahil hindi nga po kami parte nung pag-review niyan.

01:59:03.210 --> 01:59:09.850
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Bukod sa undeclared beneficial ownership, ano pa po yung nire-review ninyong enforcement department ng SEC?

01:59:11.020 --> 01:59:18.960
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, ang enforcement po is more on securities violation, investment fraud, investment scam.

01:59:23.530 --> 01:59:29.150
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yun po, yung iniimbestigahan po tungkol sa mga violation ng anti-dummy law,

01:59:29.270 --> 01:59:31.050
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: yung

01:59:32.040 --> 01:59:45.910
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: fictitious na mga incorporator, stockholders, paging po yung ultra-virus ay part po ng kanilang iniimbestigahan. So

01:59:50.960 --> 02:00:05.580
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: bukod dun sa undeclared beneficial ownership at yung ilang pang kababanggit ninyo, ano pa sa mga provisions ng Anti-Dummy Law ang nire-review ng inyong enforcement department.

02:00:12.290 --> 02:00:12.930
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nabanggit ko na po...

02:00:12.930 --> 02:00:13.470
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kung meron pa

02:00:13.470 --> 02:00:13.570
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: po.

02:00:13.670 --> 02:00:18.960
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Maraming salamat po, Attorney Del Rosario. Salamat po, Mr. Presiding Officer.

02:00:20.510 --> 02:00:32.790
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: To avail of his second round, may I acknowledge for Senator-Judge Bam Aquino, thereafter, Senator-Judge Rafi Tulfo.

02:00:34.240 --> 02:00:38.840
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Magandang araw. Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. I forgot this is my second round already.

02:00:40.780 --> 02:00:57.740
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Hindi po ito para kay Atty. Del Rosario. Gusto po nating malaman ano ba ang role ni Vice President Sara Duterte sa GEN Corp. Okay? Hindi talaga ito malalaman ng ating witness. Hindi niyo po yan malalaman, di ba?

02:00:57.740 --> 02:00:58.640
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

02:00:58.640 --> 02:01:08.660
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. Ang alam lang natin, si Vice President Sara mismo, Yung naglagay ng kumpanyang GenCorp sa kanyang SAL-N. Is that correct, Atty. Erwin?

02:01:10.580 --> 02:01:14.960
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor, for her 2024 and 2025 SAL-Ns.

02:01:14.980 --> 02:01:26.400
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Meaning, ang Vice President mismo ang naglagay ng kumpanya sa kanyang SAL-N kaya natin nalaman na meron siyang interes. Pero hindi natin alam kung ano mismo yung interes na iyon.

02:01:27.580 --> 02:01:30.620
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Nilagay po sa SAL-N SH.

02:01:32.600 --> 02:01:33.690
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: SH?

02:01:33.690 --> 02:01:37.880
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: SH, which presupposes that stockholder po.

02:01:38.540 --> 02:01:42.450
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, pero wala siya sa GIS, correct no? Tama to?

02:01:42.450 --> 02:01:43.230
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

02:01:43.230 --> 02:02:12.490
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So, sa palagay ko, merong confusion ngayon, paikot-ikot tayo. Dalawang tao lang yung makakaalam kung ano talaga yung role niya. Siya mismo, so let me ask Atty. Justin, of course, ikaw na bahala kung alam mo itong sagot o kung sasagutin mo. So ang kliyente ninyo, ang respondent, siya mismo yung naglagay ng GenCorp sa kanyang salin. Ano nga ba ang kanyang role sa GenCorp?

02:02:13.160 --> 02:02:38.030
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, with all due respect, and while I understand where you're coming from, it would be premature for the defense to discuss those matters because currently, Your Honor, it is the prosecution's turn. And may we ask to refer this question to the presiding officer since I believe the impeachment court is a passive body and it should receive evidence at a timely time. Atatlayan niyo part of the proceedings which is at this point, Your Honor, premature. Apologies, Senator Judge.

02:02:38.030 --> 02:02:38.050
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Yes, I

02:02:38.050 --> 02:03:15.320
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: was expecting that answer, Attorney Justin. Pero ibabalikan ko lang yung nasabi ng mga Amici Q. Ray na at the end of the day, itong courting ito is sui generis and we can follow our own path towards truth and fairness. That's why I'm giving you this option. Ang sinasabi mo, you will probably answer this during your time. So I respect that. The other person na pwede magsabi kung ano yung role ni Vice President Sara is of course GenCorp. Si GenCorp mismo. So sino bang presidente ng GenCorp? Nasa ano niyo po ba? Attorney Del Rosario? Sino po bang corporate officers ng GenCorp?

02:03:17.660 --> 02:03:23.680
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Sa palagay ko, sila mismo pwede magsabi kung ano yung role ni Vice President Sara ito sa GenCorp.

02:03:25.550 --> 02:03:28.030
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Who are the corporate officers? Who are the owners?

02:03:58.680 --> 02:04:01.060
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Corporate Secretary po ay si Gurley S. Delacruz.

02:04:01.460 --> 02:04:11.830
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So, any of them would be able to tell us ano ba ang role ni Vice President Sara Duterte dito as corporate officers? Tama po ba?

02:04:11.830 --> 02:04:12.400
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

02:04:12.600 --> 02:04:12.980
Atty. Roberto N. Batungbacal: Okay.

02:04:13.160 --> 02:04:28.100
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So, I leave that to the prosecution kasi lang nais nating malaman ano ba talaga ang role niya dito. It's possible it could, maybe it's, maybe it could even be her husband. Hindi natin alam, di ba? Tama ba?

02:04:29.620 --> 02:04:37.420
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Atty. Erwin, pag naglalagay ka ng salin, posibleng yung asawa yung nakatukoy sa mga business interests, correct?

02:04:37.420 --> 02:04:39.970
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Posible po, or anak, pwede rin po yun.

02:04:39.970 --> 02:04:55.720
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, so we don't know. The answer is we don't know and we want to know, we want to find out. So, sa palagay ko, ito pong witness natin, nasagot niya yung kaya niyang masagot. Pero yung ibang mga kasagutan dito, ibang tao na siguro yung pwedeng sumagot. Yun lang po, Mr. Presiding Officer. Maraming salamat.

02:04:55.840 --> 02:05:03.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you. With the indulgence of Senator-Judge JV, who is availing of his first round, I believe Senator-Judge Raffi has only one question.

02:05:05.480 --> 02:05:09.860
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Then, Senator-Judge Raffi.

02:05:14.770 --> 02:06:02.650
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Kahapon po, bilang sagot sa tanong ko, Atty. Gular responded that my question called for an answer. to a hypothetical question. Tama naman kung datusin. Kasi hindi naman po sila ang tinasabi kong brilliant lawyers ni VP Sara when she ran for vice president. Now, ito ang tanong ko para kay Attorney Del Rosario. Para po hindi na maging hypothetical ang tanong ko, kung isang public official ay pasok sa enumeration ng Article 7, Section 13 ng Constitution, automatic po ba na dapat mag-divest ng opisyal? base sa regulasyon ng SEC. Ang sagot po ninyo kahapon, walang ganong regulasyon at least at the level of the SEC. Tama?

02:06:03.270 --> 02:07:16.960
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Yung pong sagot ko on that ay kung meron kaming guidelines to report. Kung ang opisyalis na ito ay magtayo ng kumpanya o maging parte ng kumpanya, wala po kaming guidelines on that na dapat namin siyang i-report sa OP, sa Senate, sa House, o sa Judiciary. o sa ombudsman to flag yung mga tao na iyon. Yun po yung wala kaming guidelines. Pero kung sa yung tanong niyo po ngayon kung dapat po siyang may divest, malinaw mo naman po sa batas na meron prohibition. Na dapat sana, alam niya, bilang mataas na ka-opisyal ng gobyerno, na pinanumpaan niya nun siya ay nag-swear to act as president, vice president, na iyon ang Iyon ang kanyang limitasyon. Kaya dapat sana bago siya nanumpa, tinanggal na niya o nag-divest na po siya. Na nakita naman po natin meron ditong GES na kung saan na hindi naging party na si Bibi Sara sa ilang kumpanya nung dumating yung at least 2019 pa po nga ay hindi na rin nag-appear yung kanyang pangalan. Siguro yun po yung divestment.

02:07:17.600 --> 02:07:34.860
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Maraming salamat po sa inyong kasagutan. So, binigit po ninyo that the SEC does not proactively flag these cases. Sino pong ordinarily ang dapat makapansin at mag-correct nito kung kailangan ng koreksyon? Tama po ba na ang documents are ordinarily prepared by the Corporate Secretary?

02:07:34.860 --> 02:07:35.960
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

02:07:37.540 --> 02:08:13.510
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nangyayari naman po sa amin yan na mayroong pagkakamali yung opisyal na nagsumite. Ang usual na nangyayari po ay nagpapahal sila sa atin ng petition to amend or to correct yung document. So long na within the jurisdiction ng aming tanggapan, yung issue of correction, gagawin po namin. Pero upang correction will entail corporate, meron po ng tinatawag na intra-corporate controversy. Let's say, tinanggal siya, bakit ako tinanggal? That's issue of corporate controversy which we refer the matter to the regular court.

02:08:14.190 --> 02:08:38.450
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Thank you, sir. So, may ibang records pa po ba sa SEC na magpapakita kung ang direktor ba ay pumirma ng mga resolusyons, bumoto on any corporate decision, or nag-participate in management after assuming office? Kasi gusto lang po namin maging fair dito. We want the court to decide or come up with legal conclusions based on only on the documents and evidence available to us.

02:08:39.820 --> 02:09:00.360
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po kaming record unless mag-submit sila dahil ang talagang Inaasahan namin i-submitin nila sa amin ay yung JS at financial statement lang. Pero on this, wala po kami makitang resolusyon showing na yung participation niya sa kumpanyang ito, na nilagdaan niya. Wala po kami ganong informasyon.

02:09:00.700 --> 02:09:03.820
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Thank you, sir. No further questions. Thank

02:09:03.820 --> 02:09:10.420
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: you, Senator-Judge Rafi. Senator-Judge Javy, you may proceed when you're ready. You have two minutes, sir.

02:09:10.600 --> 02:09:11.840
Sen. Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

02:09:14.030 --> 02:09:28.370
Sen. Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: If a person is a shareholder of a corporation but has never received any dividends from it, does the absence of dividends income meaning that he has no participation in the business or no financial interest in the corporation?

02:09:41.350 --> 02:09:48.270
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Siya po ay may interest sa korporasyon. Meron na siyang matanggap o walang dibidendo, hindi po yan

02:09:48.270 --> 02:09:48.410
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ang

02:09:48.410 --> 02:09:57.610
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: basehan para sabihin niya na hindi na siya stockholder. Kinakailangan hawak pa rin po niya yung interest, yung shares of stock para sabihin shareholder pa rin siya.

02:09:58.460 --> 02:10:32.640
Sen. Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang isa pa po ay if a person is merely a shareholder of a corporation without taking part in its management, yung kanina sinabi ni Senator-Judge Tulpo, operations or business decisions, Does the mere continued ownership of shares by itself mean that the person is willfully continuing to engage in the business or corporation? Ang shareholder po ba ay hindi man lang nakikilahok sa pamamahala, operasyon, o disisyon ng negosyo? Ibig sabihin ba ay nangalugan ba na willfully continue to engage in the business ng korporasyon pa rin po siya?

02:10:33.840 --> 02:10:36.440
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tulad po nang sabi ko, habang hawak mo ang shares of stock,

02:10:36.990 --> 02:10:37.430
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Kung

02:10:37.430 --> 02:10:43.970
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ngayong participation ay dispassive, umaasa ka lang sa dividendo o wala kang matanggap, shareholder pa

02:10:43.970 --> 02:11:00.850
Sen. Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: rin po kayo. At ang huli po, ayan, gusto ko lang liwanagin din yung kaninang punto po ng Senator-Judge Hontiveros. Yung isang public official ba, yung pagkakaroon ba ng financial interest ay sapat na po bang sa GIS lamang o kinakailangan sa SAL-M din po? Para malaman.

02:11:02.060 --> 02:11:34.010
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Well, unang-una nga po, ang... Ang information sa ating JS ay information na nanggagaling sa corporation through the corporate secretary. Yung SAL-N naman po ay personal na ginagawa noong empleyado. Dapat po sana kung ano ang pag-aari niya, kung ano ang pagkakautang niya, isaad niya ng tama sa SAL-N. Kasi yan naman po ang inaasahan. At yan po ang dahilan kung bakit tayo nagkaroon ng SAL-N. Para maging transparent tayo, i-disclose natin ang lahat ng yaman natin, maging ang utang natin, ilagay natin doon. No further questions, Mr.

02:11:34.110 --> 02:11:34.310
Sen. Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: President?

02:11:35.050 --> 02:11:58.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator-Judge. Just a few interjections from the chair. We shall be done in a few minutes. And we will be resuming at 1 o'clock after lunch. Atty. Del Rosario, normal po ba o kakaiba na walang dinedeklaran dividendo ang mga kumpanyang dumadaan sa inyo, base sa inyong mga dokumentong nare-receive mula sa iba't ibang tao?

02:11:59.100 --> 02:12:04.200
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Una-una po, ang talagang basihan kung bakit gustong mag-invest ng isang shareholder is yung

02:12:04.200 --> 02:12:04.720
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: dividendo. Hindi po yun ang

02:12:04.720 --> 02:12:15.030
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: tanong ko. Base po ba sa mga dine-report sa inyo, sa mga natatanggap yung dokumento, normal po ba o kakaiba na walang dinedeklaran dividendo ang isang kumpanya?

02:12:15.790 --> 02:12:20.210
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Nasabihin ko po ang kakaiba dahil meron naman po siyang unrestricted retained earnings.

02:12:20.670 --> 02:12:23.530
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kung meron unrestricted retained earnings. At

02:12:23.530 --> 02:12:28.990
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ang binigay naman po ng batas is word na may. Ibig sabihin, discretion pa rin ng board. So

02:12:28.990 --> 02:12:57.090
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: normal po siya kung may unrestricted retained earnings. Tama po. Hindi po siya... Normal at bawal siya pag wala. Tama po. So ang tanong ko po, hindi pa rin niyo po nasasagot. Sa mga dokumentong pinaproseso niyo sa dinami-dami po niya ng opisina niyo, ang normal po ba o kakaiba ang pagdeklara ng dividendo? Meron man o walang unrestricted retained earnings ang isang kumpanya? Ano po yung mas marami? Yung nagdede-deklara ng dividendo o yung hindi?

02:12:58.110 --> 02:13:00.570
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Wala po ako nakitang nagdeklara ng dividendo.

02:13:02.470 --> 02:13:03.950
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Basis ang nire-report sa inyo?

02:13:04.170 --> 02:13:09.220
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Opo. Sa mga kumpanya ito, maliban sa mga kumpanya na nabanggit po kahapon. Hindi lang po

02:13:09.220 --> 02:13:22.230
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: ito. Yung ibang sinusumete sa inyo. Base po sa inyong malawak na karanasan bilang opisyal ng SEC, normal po bang nagde-declare, mas marami po ba nagde-declare ng dividendo o hindi?

02:13:22.980 --> 02:13:23.440
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: I

02:13:23.440 --> 02:13:26.300
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: assume po na mayroon pong marami nagde-declare ng dividendo.

02:13:26.740 --> 02:13:27.760
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Marami din pong wala?

02:13:28.180 --> 02:13:29.160
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Marami din pong wala.

02:13:29.440 --> 02:13:31.820
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kung bibigyan niyo po ng prosento, 50-50?

02:13:34.160 --> 02:13:34.680
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Maaaring

02:13:34.680 --> 02:13:34.940
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: ganun

02:13:34.940 --> 02:13:39.030
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: po. So, kalahati nagdedeklara, kalahati hindi. At wala naman po ang bawal doon. O,

02:13:39.050 --> 02:13:40.050
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: para po sa taong iyon.

02:13:40.510 --> 02:13:40.980
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Apo.

02:13:40.980 --> 02:13:50.130
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Ngayon, ang Executive Committee po ay nilikha ng Board of Directors para kumatawan sa kanya, hindi po ba?

02:13:50.130 --> 02:13:51.110
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

02:13:51.110 --> 02:13:54.010
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Mas maliit na Board of Directors po siya, hindi po ba?

02:13:54.010 --> 02:13:54.960
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

02:13:54.960 --> 02:14:01.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Hindi po siya ang nagpapatakbo ng pang-araw-araw na gawain ng kumpanya o day-to-day operations, ika nga?

02:14:01.710 --> 02:14:02.350
Atty. Gerardo F. del Rosario: Tama po.

02:14:02.670 --> 02:14:03.930
